---
title: Generated capability state
---
flowchart TD
  Request[Index rebuild] --> Lock{Writer lock free?}
  Lock -->|No| Retry[Report busy; preserve files]
  Lock -->|Yes| Existing{Current index exists?}
  Existing -->|Yes| Current[Read matching metadata]
  Existing -->|No| Legacy[Read legacy metadata]
  Current --> Build[Build from canonical assets]
  Legacy --> Build
  Build --> Graph[Atomically replace graph]
  Graph --> Index[Atomically replace index]
  Index --> Unlock[Release writer lock]
  Legacy -.-> Preserve[Legacy files stay unchanged]
